# NOITE's pharaoh (3ffarao) runs the real ENCAIXE, which wins: NOITE gets
# 0x40c (hides), then 0x40a won with +1500, shows itself, adds the score
# and goes to the hall.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3ffarao --ms 120000 --input tools/play/encaixe-3ffarao-win.input
#
# The pharaoh video ends at 35055, WinExec; ENCAIXE starts 1500 ms later
# (36555, seed 800000036). The moves are `tools/encaixe_plan.py --start
# 36555`. Same game with `--fix all`.
